@Catalog.API_HostAddress = http://localhost

### GET catálogo completo
GET {{Catalog.API_HostAddress}}/api/CatalogItems?pageSize=10&pageIndex=0
Accept: application/json

### POST nuevo producto
POST {{Catalog.API_HostAddress}}/api/CatalogItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kind of Blue - Miles Davis (LP)",
  "description": "Edición en vinilo de 180 g",
  "price": 29.9,
  "catalogType": "Jazz",
  "catalogBrand": "Columbia",
  "availableStock": 25,
  "restockThreshold": 5,
  "maxStockThreshold": 50,
  "onReorder": false
}

### GET producto por id
GET {{Catalog.API_HostAddress}}/api/CatalogItems/1
Accept: application/json

### PUT cambiar el nombre del producto (por id)
PUT {{Catalog.API_HostAddress}}/api/CatalogItems/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kind of Blue (Miles Davis) - LP",
  "description": "Edición en vinilo de 180 g",
  "price": 29.9,
  "catalogType": "Jazz",
  "catalogBrand": "Columbia",
  "availableStock": 25,
  "restockThreshold": 5,
  "maxStockThreshold": 50,
  "onReorder": false
}

### PUT modificar el precio (por nombre) - publica el evento en RabbitMQ
PUT {{Catalog.API_HostAddress}}/api/CatalogItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Abbey Road - The Beatles (LP)",
  "description": "Edición remasterizada en vinilo de 180 g",
  "price": 32.5,
  "catalogType": "Rock",
  "catalogBrand": "Apple Records",
  "availableStock": 100,
  "restockThreshold": 10,
  "maxStockThreshold": 100,
  "onReorder": false
}
